 also have multiple <strong>endings</strong> depending on how much you <strong>explore</strong>, find new places or ways to defend yourself or progress further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["TheOnlyWayOut"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3785320","name":"Chainsaw Snuff Shots VR"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787400/4ef8b2aaf960b4ab1fd05584d46f9bb773f36ecb/header.jpg?t=1749600392","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257155185,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155185/movie480.mp4?t=1749600391","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155185/movie_max.mp4?t=1749600391"},"name":"gejmplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257155185/94e724080ef629b9bc193ca94f23a899f9988da9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749600391","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155185/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749600391","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257155185/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749600391"}}],"name":"Chainsaw Snuff Shots Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 processor<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</stro